  "title": "Any Flavor Taffy",
  "description": "This taffy is made with simple ingredients. It's soft and can be made in a wide variety of flavors. The secret to the softness is the cornstarch.",
  "authors": [
    "The Scone"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:08:28-04:00",
